  {
    "id": 6901001090010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』優勝、本当におめでとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6901001090010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "私も会場で見てたんですけど、\r\n発表の瞬間、思わず大声を出しちゃいましたよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6901001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "今もまだ興奮しちゃってて、\r\n今日はもう眠れそうにありません！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6901001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、はづきさん！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "本当によくやった\r\n期待以上の結果を出してくれたな",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6902001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長も……ありがとうございます！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ふふ。私と社長も会場に来てましたけど、\r\nすごかったですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6901001090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "優勝したってわかった瞬間、社長が泣いてしまって……\r\nステージをほとんど見れていませんでしたから",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6901001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "こ、こら！\r\n彼の前でそういうことを言うな！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6902001090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "それだけ優勝したのを\r\n喜んでたってことじゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6901001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "そ、それはそうだが……",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6902001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "社長、本当にありがとうございます！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……とにかく。もっと礼を言うべき相手、\r\nいや、祝うべき相手がいるんじゃないか",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6902001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうですね\r\n今日の主役は、他でもない彼女ですから",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6902001090050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "なら、私たちのことは気にせず\r\n早く行ってこい",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6902001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "彼女のこと、いっぱい\r\n褒めてあげてくださいねー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6901001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい！　もちろんです！",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "bg": "00002",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffect": "mask"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ああ、プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6901001090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6901001090090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "霧子さんだったら公園だと思いますよ\r\nそろそろ迎えに行ってあげてくださいね",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6901001090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……は、はい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "text": "（霧子……なんでまた公園に……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（優勝……したんだから、普通に喜んでるよな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……でも霧子のことだ……\r\n優勝だって心配事になりかねないか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00016",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffect": "fade"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あ、霧子 ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "霧子、迎えに──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090010,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "まき……まき……♪\r\n……ふふ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "008",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090020,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "……あっ、プ、プロデューサーさん……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……っと、つい見惚れてしまった……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（こんなこと、前にもあったな──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……迎えにきたぞ\r\n寒くないか、霧子",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090030,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "は、はい……\r\nすみません……ご心配をおかけしました……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、いいんだ\r\nでも……包帯を巻いてたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090040,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんていうか……\r\nまた何か……心配してたりしないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090050,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090060,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "はい……いえ……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090070,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "……思い出してたんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090080,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "今までのこと……\r\nライブとか、レッスンとか",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090090,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "どうして今……\r\nアイドルやってるのかな、とか……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それは──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090100,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "い、いえ……後ろ向きな意味じゃないんです……！",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charAnim3": "face_wait",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090110,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "その……わたしなりに、\r\n自分を変えたくって……始めたことだったなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……\r\nオーディションでそう言ってたのはよく覚えてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090120,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "ふふ……はい……",
    "charAnim2": "yes",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090130,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんに\r\n「変わらなくてもいいんだ」って教えてもらって──",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090140,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "わたし、すごく変われたんだなって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090150,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "さっき、ステージの上で……\r\nたくさんの人に……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090150"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090160,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "たくさんの人に、感謝しました……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……うん\r\n霧子は、本当に……びっくりするくらい成長したな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090170,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "……包帯のこと、やめるように言わなかったり\r\n怖がらずに……接してくださったり",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "no",
    "charAnim3": "face_anger",
    "charAnim2Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090180,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "最初は、それが嬉しくって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、うん。",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090190,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "でも、こんなところまで来れたのは……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090190"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090200,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが\r\nそばで……ずっと見ていてくださったからです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや俺は、\r\n最初に応接室に迎えにいったときも、今も──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ずっと霧子に魅了されてるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090210,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "プ、プロデューサーさん……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090210"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090220,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "……じゃあ、ずっと……見ていてください\r\n良いところも、悪いところも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090220"
  },
  {
    "id": 6008001090230,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "わたしのことを……\r\nずっと、ずーっと……見守っていてください……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600800109/6008001090230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、霧子\r\nまだまだ……これからなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "頑張ろうな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]